<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="art-card">
    <canvas
      id="paletteCanvas"
      class="visual-canvas"
      type="2d"
      aria-label="根据声音生成的抽象画面"
    ></canvas>
    <view wx:if="{{isListening}}" class="listening-overlay">
      <text class="listening-kicker">{{listeningKicker}}</text>
      <text class="countdown">{{remainingSeconds}}</text>
      <view class="progress-track">
        <view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{progressPercent}}%;"></view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{listeningMode === 'microphone'}}" class="sound-response">
        <view class="sound-response-header">
          <text>声音响应</text>
          <text>{{liveLevelPercent}}%</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sound-response-track">
          <view
            class="sound-response-fill"
            style="width: {{liveLevelPercent}}%;"
          ></view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <text class="listening-note">{{listeningNote}}</text>
      <button class="stop-button" bindtap="stopListening">停止聆听</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <canvas
    id="exportCanvas"
    class="export-canvas"
    type="2d"
    aria-label="作品导出画布"
  ></canvas>

  <view class="content">
    <block wx:if="{{isHome}}">
      <text class="eyebrow">SOUND PALETTE · 本机分析</text>
      <text class="title">我的声音相册</text>
      <text class="copy">
        给周围的声音十秒钟，让厚度、流动与明亮细节长成一幅只属于此刻的画。
      </text>
      <view wx:if="{{statusMessage}}" class="status-card">
        <text>{{statusMessage}}</text>
      </view>
      <button
        class="primary-button"
        loading="{{isPreparing}}"
        disabled="{{isPreparing}}"
        bindtap="startMicrophone"
      >
        开始十秒聆听
      </button>
      <button
        wx:if="{{showPermissionHelp}}"
        class="secondary-button compact-button"
        open-type="openSetting"
        bindopensetting="handleOpenSetting"
      >
        去设置开启麦克风
      </button>
      <button
        class="secondary-button sample-button"
        disabled="{{isPreparing}}"
        bindtap="startSample"
      >
        先体验内置示例
      </button>
      <text class="privacy-note">
        声音只在本机分析，不识别语音、不上传；微信生成的临时录音文件在结束后立即删除。
      </text>
      <view wx:if="{{hasRecordingDiagnostics}}" class="diagnostic-card">
        <text class="diagnostic-title">上次清理记录</text>
        <view
          wx:for="{{recordingDiagnostics}}"
          wx:key="label"
          class="diagnostic-row"
        >
          <text>{{item.label}}</text>
          <text>{{item.value}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <block wx:elif="{{isListening}}">
      <text class="eyebrow">
        {{listeningMode === 'microphone' ? '正在聆听此刻' : '正在聆听示例'}}
      </text>
      <text class="state-title">{{listeningTitle}}</text>
      <text class="copy">画面会随声音变化，但原始音频不会保存或上传。</text>
    </block>

    <block wx:elif="{{isMood}}">
      <text class="eyebrow">声音已经有了形状</text>
      <text class="state-title">此刻感觉如何？</text>
      <text class="copy">选择只改变色彩、光线与运动倾向，画面的构图不会跳变。</text>
      <view class="mood-list">
        <button
          wx:for="{{moodOptions}}"
          wx:key="id"
          class="mood-option {{selectedMood === item.id ? 'is-selected' : ''}}"
          data-mood="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="selectMood"
        >
          <text class="mood-label">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="mood-detail">{{item.detail}}</text>
        </button>
      </view>
      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="showResult">收下这张声音相片</button>
    </block>

    <block wx:elif="{{isResult}}">
      <text class="eyebrow">MY SOUND ALBUM · 001</text>
      <text class="state-title">十秒，留住一个瞬间</text>
      <view class="tag-list">
        <text wx:for="{{tags}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag">{{item}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="composition-card">
        <view wx:for="{{composition}}" wx:key="label" class="composition-row">
          <text>{{item.label}}</text>
          <view class="composition-track">
            <view class="composition-fill" style="width: {{item.value}}%;"></view>
          </view>
          <text>{{item.value}}%</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{hasRecordingDiagnostics}}" class="diagnostic-card">
        <text class="diagnostic-title">本次本机分析</text>
        <view
          wx:for="{{recordingDiagnostics}}"
          wx:key="label"
          class="diagnostic-row"
        >
          <text>{{item.label}}</text>
          <text>{{item.value}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{exportStatus}}" class="status-card export-status">
        <text>{{exportStatus}}</text>
      </view>
      <button
        class="primary-button"
        loading="{{isExporting}}"
        disabled="{{isExporting}}"
        bindtap="saveArtwork"
      >
        保存图片
      </button>
      <button
        class="secondary-button compact-button"
        disabled="{{isExporting}}"
        bindtap="shareArtwork"
      >
        分享图片
      </button>
      <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="restart">再听一个瞬间</button>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{showPrivacy}}" class="privacy-backdrop">
    <view class="privacy-dialog" role="dialog" aria-label="隐私授权说明">
      <text class="privacy-title">开始前，请确认隐私说明</text>
      <text class="privacy-copy">
        点击同意后，本次仅使用麦克风分析十秒实时 PCM 数值，不识别语音，不上传声音。
        微信生成的临时录音文件会在停止后立即删除。
      </text>
      <text class="privacy-contract">{{privacyContractName}}</text>
      <button
        id="agreePrivacyButton"
        class="primary-button privacy-action"
        open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization"
        bindagreeprivacyauthorization="handleAgreePrivacyAuthorization"
      >
        同意并继续
      </button>
      <button
        class="secondary-button privacy-action"
        bindtap="declinePrivacyAuthorization"
      >
        暂不使用麦克风
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
